// REJECTS: Unsupported persistence platform type 'AzureBatch'
//
// The third island, and the only one in the PersistenceContext element: `platform:`.
// `platformSpecification: platformType (platformValue)?`, platformType is `identifier`, and
// the sole registered PersistencePlatform is `AwsGlue` -- which is where the entire
// PersistenceCloudLexerGrammar lives.
//
// All three islands (trigger, platform, target) share this shape, and all three fail the
// same way through IPersistenceParserExtension.process. A file per island, because the
// message names the island kind and that is the part worth pinning.
###Persistence
PersistenceContext test::persistence::neg::InventedPlatform
{
  persistence: test::persistence::TestPersistence;
  platform: AzureBatch
  #{
    dataProcessingUnits: 10;
  }#;
}
